ensive moveset to fight your way to the top.<br></li><li> Execute techniques with perfect timing to unleash powered-up attacks.<br></li><li> Strategically build up and expend Energy to use Strong Punches and Rapid Flurries.<br></li><li> Enjoy a deeply satisfying combat engine with full damage modeling. Beat the enemy's glasses off, knock out their teeth, and give 'em a black eye.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/f15034465c8884aecfe5daa184b3e859.poster.avif?t=1755310907\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/f15034465c8884aecfe5daa184b3e859.webm?t=1755310907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/f15034465c8884aecfe5daa184b3e859.mp4?t=1755310907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/9194502b4d8c924cd74fc13d0090a7b4.poster.avif?t=1755310907\" width=600 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/9194502b4d8c924cd74fc13d0090a7b4.webm?t=1755310907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1177330/extras/9194502b4d8c924cd74fc13d0090a7b4.mp4?t=1755310907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hype up the crowd by landing tricky-to-use attacks that demonstrate your skill.<br></li><li> Learn to use the Hyper version of each attack, which is less effective yet more rewarding.<br></li><li> Roll with the punches and beat Hyper Missions.<br></li><li> Bet on your own skill. Ante up before each match and reap the rewards or 